Quick Start
============

-v0.1 2022.4.7   WangZhou init
-v0.2 2023.1.11  WangZhou add LinxInit debug

Abstract: This document shares how to use Block ISA qemu.

Repo
-----

 https://codehub-dg-y.huawei.com/LinxISA/LinxBlockModel.git

 Mainline about Block ISA is linx-dev. It is suggested to use the latest commit
 in linx-dev.

Compile
--------

 In root of qemu, run:

 ./configure --target-list=linx-softmmu
 make -j4

 When compiling is done, qemu-system-linx will be found in qemu/build directory.

 NOTE: you may need install some dependent libraries.

Run
----

 qemu-system-linx -m 2048M -nographic -smp 2 \
    -machine virt \
    -kernel <your kernel Image> \
    -append "console=ttyS0 earlycon root=/dev/ram rdinit=/init" \
    -initrd <your root fs>

